@unicron/tokens
Copyright 2026 Sean Sands

Portions derived from snds/mailbird, Apache-2.0, and shadcn/ui, MIT: the shadcn/ui
token contract (background, foreground, card, popover, primary, secondary, muted,
accent, destructive, border, input, ring, radius and the sidebar roles) that the
semantic tier keeps as aliases, and the token set Mailbird started from.

The contrast tool (scripts/contrast.mjs, the bin unicron-contrast) measures APCA
contrast with apca-w3 (https://github.com/Myndex/apca-w3), which is installed as a
package and is not redistributed here.
